      <marc:subfield code="a">Kuck kuch Hota Hai is a story of 2 bestfriends at college. Rahul (Shahrukh Khan) and tomboy Anjali (Kajol). Unknown to Rahul, Anjali has fallen in lone with him. When Rahul confesses that he is in love with Tina (Rani Mukerji), Anjali is heartbroken and decides to leave the college so that Rahul ang Tina can get together. Now, nine years have passed and Rahul is a single parent after Tina&apos;s demise. Kuch kuch Hota hai is a story of best friends.. Now they are falling in love.</marc:subfield>
